  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisation Development: Security and Feedback Mechanisms Capacity Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jesuit Hakimani centre has been an ABG programme partner since 2008 implementing research-based advocacy projects. In July 2014, ABG programme held a partners training in Addis Ababa, Ethiopia. Major areas of focus were gender, complaints handling mechanisms and security management. These form part of the ABG result areas for 2013-2015. JHC made commitment to develop organization security management policy and a complaints handing mechanism.

This project has therefore been set up to support JHC to develop these key policy documents before between April to September 2015.
The total amount requested for is &#xa3;9,780.53</narrative>
  </description>
